{"unit_id":"Stmol__dsh-rub-cost#feature-session-cost","repo":"Stmol/dsh-rub-cost","commit":"2d432a4929ef84a3ae7d9947732a966f1f6eec5b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@stmol/dsh-rub-cost 的功能「会话费用」：根据 tokenUsage、最近使用的模型及当前峰谷费率估算会话美元成本，再按卢布汇率换算；金额显示在对话栏按钮和弹出的费用卡片中。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:364","client.js:994","client.js:1233"]}
