{"unit_id":"Stmol__dsh-rub-cost#feature-wallet","repo":"Stmol/dsh-rub-cost","commit":"2d432a4929ef84a3ae7d9947732a966f1f6eec5b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@stmol/dsh-rub-cost 的功能「DeepSeek 钱包余额」：插件挂载和每次打开费用面板时读取账户余额，并在面板列出钱包与非零奖励余额。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:662","client.js:1421"]}
{"unit_id":"Stmol__dsh-rub-cost#caveat-rate-source","repo":"Stmol/dsh-rub-cost","commit":"2d432a4929ef84a3ae7d9947732a966f1f6eec5b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"@stmol/dsh-rub-cost 使用前须知：卢布换算依赖 www.cbr-xml-daily.ru 的汇率数据；成功获取的汇率会缓存在浏览器中，网络刷新失败时沿用上次结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:220","client.js:638"]}
